{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18955","headline":"故相国燕国公于司空挽歌二首 二 · 刘禹锡","name":"故相国燕国公于司空挽歌二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阴山贵公子，来葬五陵西。\n前马悲无主，犹带朔风嘶。\n汉水晋山郭，襄杨白铜鞮。\n至今有遗爱，日暮人凄凄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18955.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18955","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}